*  qsetp_mn: Lower Reactive Power Limit in Mvar
*  iQorient: Orientation:+Q:-Q
*  ilcph: Phase:a:b:c:a-b:b-c:c-a:Pos.Seq.
*  rpara: Layout Parameter (per Step): Parallel Resistance in Ohm
*  i_cont: Tap Changer:discrete:continuous
********************************************************************************
